          "title": "You'll want to know: 这些",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "这些 — zhèxiē — \"these\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "这些是我以前的书 zhèxiē shì wǒ yǐqián de shū — These are my old books."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The new character, in pieces: 些 (xiē) — on top a four-stroke piece and a two-stroke piece side by side, and under them the two bars of 二. The next lesson puts it in your hand."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
