          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "这些 (zhèxiē) is built from 这 'this' and 些 (xiē) 'a few'. The second is inherited from Middle Chinese sjae (Guangyun, in Baxter's transcription), glossed 'a little'."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
